          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Nearer than the last time you asked, yet further than we will be the next. Really apprentice, would it kill you to learn a proper seeker spell?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("There’s no need to be so glum, master. As the head of our delegation, you’ll even get to counsel with the king himself! What I wouldn’t give for a chance to prove myself to him..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("<i>_Quiet!</i> <span size='small'>_Do you hear that?</span>"),
